          <groundspeak:finder id="2582877">manjalou</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP316 Alliance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After Leaving AlLiance we drove down the highway and stopped on a side road by the bridge going over the river. We crossed the highway and quickly spotted the BCP. It just needed a brush off and it was ready for pictures. We took the pictures quickly before the next vehicle came down the highway. Luckily it wasn’t too busy today. thanks for the cap outforthehunt and great views here&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
